<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BankWest sets US$250 mln FRN issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BankWest sets US$250 mln FRN issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Western Australia Ltd (BankWest) said on Thursday it had launched a US$250 million floating rate note issue due July 2002 which would pay a quarterly coupon of US$ Libor plus 6.25 basis points.</p>
</text>
